6. Working Principle

The system consists of two main sections: transmitter and receiver.

The transmitter collects the required sensor or emergency information and sends it through the LoRa module. The receiver uses the SX1278 LoRa module to receive the transmitted data. The ESP8266 processes the received information and displays it on the LCD. It also hosts a web dashboard through Wi-Fi to monitor the received data.

